# Copy this file to .env (which is not committed) and restart Expo.
#
# The existing Mugabe Fitness backend the app signs in against. Everything
# prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ is built into the app in plain text: put a public
# URL here and NEVER a key, token or password.
#
# Production website (real accounts — use a test account):
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://mugabe-fitness.vercel.app
#
# Or the website running on your own computer (npm run dev in the repo
# root). Use your computer's LAN address for a physical phone, or
# http://10.0.2.2:3000 from the Android emulator:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.10:3000
